    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Gerald Boisvert",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115520519323979273904/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocItCOYj-refkN-pGkfPwI7umwWEkTry1vx-eH8yTduINGXFfQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "Very very happy over the years since we moved to the area. The service has been superb. Nancy at the front desk has always been great, knowledgeable, and capable; smiling and quick to understand.\nEspecially appreciate that she greets the customer in whatever language the customer speaks. Even if all she can do is the greeting, it sets the stage for a very pleasant experience. A month ago she noticed me speaking to a friend and his response was in sign language. She greeted him in sign language. I was delighted that she made that effort. The customers feel the warmth of personal service and attention.",
        "time": 1740005982,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Soufiane Idrissi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111814782045108044363/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXvtuUBeJaiQN8y677MjkdbCYaY9LaVIq4x7sYqHo0WRozLLyU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Very bad service! The third time they delivered my packed to a different mail box! I paid extra fees for fast delivery as I am going on vacation, and I am leaving without my package! Very disappointing and we have no other option to choose a different company. Very unprofessional!",
        "time": 1704500838,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Noozah Ansari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105154741293603635240/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTPUdj3KDYl13D4t1QYBe876CJIWHM9Iczegn0xKnq7-jl1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Ive been to this place many times. The service has been fine. But this lady that works there really disappointed me. Im asking her simple questions to make sure she is able to find the address ive written online to make sure i didnt make a mistake. Her answers r sarcastic remarks and as if shes talking to a child. Plz teach her customer service  cause this isnt it. I have had the same service at this place. before by a man who was very helpful and didnt look down on me as if i was asking dumb questions",
        "time": 1656447383,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicolas Lauriault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115260443622201905043/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUbJcnTCTjoZ0dKn1KcAdT16wSRRJFVPnkmGEep-xenMQ23PEU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "When will the strike be over and the place will re-open? This place took packages in knowing very well they were going in strike, what a joke really.",
        "time": 1731704010,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Freda K",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105284561524267742227/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIjQo7U0O8z4kSz1KtWNM568a_kEK5Sz9bwRQvWCav19WXPJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I went today around 3:30 pm. Regret not getting the name of the wonderful lady. Super friendly outstanding character.  Very efficient. Koodoos to canada post. Thank you.",
